{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-color-tube-coordinates","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:color-tube-coordinates","kind":"definition","title":"Color tube coordinates","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-braid-group-action"],"tags":["brings-surface","color-tube"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.ColorTubeCoordinates","text":"color-tube-coordinates.md","leanSource":"color-tube-coordinates.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:color-tube-coordinates\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z = x_0/x_1 \\in \\mathbb{P}^1(\\mathbb{C})</code> be the spacetime ratio (<a href=\"#rem:braid-group-action\" data-at=\"brings-surface/brings-surface-qou\">braid group action</a>(i)) and let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">w_k</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k \\in \\{0,\\dots,4\\}</code>, be the Lagrange resolvents of Bring's surface (<a href=\"#prop:lagrange-resolvent-transform\" data-at=\"braids-and-knots/braid-involutions\">Lagrange resolvent transform</a>). The <strong>color tube coordinates</strong> are the shifted spectral coordinates</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">c_r = w_2 - z, \\quad c_g = w_3 - z, \\quad c_b = w_4 - z,</code></pre>\n<p>together with the space-like shift <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma = w_1 - z</code>. The <em>color vector</em> is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c = (c_r, c_g, c_b)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.md","heading":"Definition","number":"8.5.1","page":"b/def-color-tube-coordinates","qa":{"counts":{"pass":81,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.ColorTubeCoordinates","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
